  "body": "Elevated, freehold and tightly held, 529A Riddell Road delivers the kind of family scale that's becoming increasingly difficult to find in Glendowie. Five bedrooms across two levels, sun-drenched living and wide decks catching glimpses of the water. This is a home built for the way growing families actually live.\r\n\r\nThe upper level centres on a polished, open-plan heart. A modern kitchen with island and breakfast bar flows through to dining, then into an expansive lounge warmed by a wood burner. Rich timber floors run throughout, and glass sliding doors open onto wide, sun-soaked decks where the outlook takes centre stage. Morning coffee, long summer evenings, boats drifting past: this is where the entertaining takes care of itself, with expansive water views across the Hauraki Gulf and Tamaki River as your backdrop.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a separate lower level adds exceptional flexibility. Two further bedrooms, a bathroom, seperate toilet, and a generous rumpus open onto a large covered patio, creating space for teenagers, guests or extended family to spread out. Beyond that, a flat, fully fenced lawn, a pool and lush established gardens give the kids room to roam.\r\n\r\n* Freehold standalone home on a generous 973m2 (approx.) site in a tightly held Glendowie pocket\r\n\r\n* Approx. 236m2 of living across a flexible two-level floorplan\r\n\r\n* Five bedrooms and two bathrooms, plus a separate WC\r\n\r\n* Sun-drenched open-plan living with a wood burner and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to expansive decks\r\n\r\n* Designer bathrooms\r\n\r\n* Lower-level rumpus, two bedrooms and bathroom opening to a large covered patio\r\n\r\n* Pool, fenced lawn and established subtropical gardens\r\n\r\n* Double garage plus off-street parking\r\n\r\n* In zone for Glendowie College and Churchill Park School\r\n\r\n* Excellent proximity to St Heliers village, beaches, Churchill Park and Roberta Reserve, and transport links\r\n\r\nHomes offering this much space, sun and flexibility in Glendowie are rarely available. Whether you're upsizing, settling in for the school years or simply wanting room to breathe, 529A Riddell Road is a home that simply makes sense.",
